[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 0.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "excellency Aron Palik,", "start": 2.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Vice President of the Federated States", "start": 6.08, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "of Micronesia.", "start": 8.72, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 11.2, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 13.759, "duration": 6.201}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 16.96, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 38.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General, excellencies,", "start": 40.079, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, it is it is a", "start": 44.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "distinct honor to stand in this historic", "start": 47.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "all where so many great leaders have", "start": 50.48, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "stood before to deliver my country's", "start": 53.199, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "statement to the world. On behalf of", "start": 56.399, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Micronia,", "start": 59.28, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "I extend my warmest national greetings", "start": 61.039, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "of Camarale.", "start": 63.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Let me begin by congratulating you, Mr.", "start": 66.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "President, on your election as president", "start": 68.72, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "of the 81st session of the United", "start": 71.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Nations General Assembly.", "start": 74.96, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "I also extend my Cornish appreciation to", "start": 78.0, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Secretary General Antonio Cutterz for", "start": 81.6, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "your dedicated and steadfast service,", "start": 85.36, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "principled leadership, and personal", "start": 88.479, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "commitment to the values of the United", "start": 91.119, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Nations.", "start": 94.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "As you conclude your tenure, we honor", "start": 95.84, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "your advocacy for the most vulnerable", "start": 98.88, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "and your tireless efforts in", "start": 102.64, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "strengthening multilateralism.", "start": 104.96, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "Micronia stands in solidarity with all", "start": 108.56, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "nations that have endured the the recent", "start": 112.079, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "waves of natural disasters around the", "start": 115.68, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "world. The loss of lives, displacements,", "start": 118.799, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "and destructions", "start": 123.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "remind us of our common vulnerability.", "start": 125.36, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "We extend our deepest condolences to the", "start": 129.44, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "governments and peoples affected and we", "start": 132.48, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "honor the courage of those who chose to", "start": 136.08, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "help in the face of tragedy.", "start": 140.0, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Mr. President and Excellencies,", "start": 144.0, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "the theme of this session, and I quote,", "start": 147.12, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "restoring trust, managing", "start": 151.44, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 153.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "a United Nations that delivers for all.", "start": 155.36, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "It speaks directly to our realities of", "start": 160.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "our small islands in Micronia.", "start": 162.319, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "We need the benefits of digital", "start": 166.08, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "innovation,", "start": 167.84, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "artificial intelligence,", "start": 169.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "energy transition, and institutional", "start": 172.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "reforms.", "start": 175.28, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "At the same time, we recognize the", "start": 177.92, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "continuing and growing challenges of", "start": 180.64, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "climate change, ocean degradation,", "start": 183.84, "duration": 9.0}, {"text": "pollution, and growing inequality.", "start": 187.599, "duration": 5.241}, {"text": "Mr. President and Excellencies,", "start": 194.8, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "today's security landscape is not only", "start": 198.879, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "by conflict but by climatedriven", "start": 202.64, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "fragility.", "start": 205.92, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Extreme weather events, sea level rise,", "start": 207.92, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "and resource degradation are eroding", "start": 211.76, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "stability across vulnerable regions,", "start": 214.879, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "especially the Pacific.", "start": 219.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "These pressures intensify humanitarian", "start": 222.4, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "needs, disrupt food and water systems", "start": 225.68, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and strain governance government's", "start": 229.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "capacities.", "start": 233.68, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "For Micronia,", "start": 235.2, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "climate impact are a national concern.", "start": 237.04, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "We underscore the importance of", "start": 242.799, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "safeguarding maritime security across", "start": 244.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "the blue Pacific.", "start": 247.28, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "illegal, unreported and unregulated", "start": 250.0, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "fishing activities,", "start": 253.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "transnational crimes and environmental", "start": 255.439, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "degradation threatened", "start": 258.72, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "not only our economies but the health of", "start": 261.68, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "our marine environment as well.", "start": 265.52, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "We urge the international community to", "start": 269.36, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "enhance cooperation,", "start": 272.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "shared technology, and support capacity", "start": 274.479, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "building to ensure that the ocean", "start": 277.68, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "remains a zone of peace governed by", "start": 280.639, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "international law.", "start": 284.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Mr. President and Excellencies,", "start": 288.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "the challenges that impede our", "start": 290.72, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "sustainable development are increasing.", "start": 293.28, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "We must respond by implementing", "start": 297.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "science-based emission reductions,", "start": 299.919, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "scale up national climate commitments,", "start": 303.44, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "and accelerate transition to renewable", "start": 306.639, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "energy.", "start": 309.759, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "We demand accessible and predictable", "start": 312.08, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "adaptation grant financing to support", "start": 314.639, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "investments in resilient infrastructure.", "start": 318.479, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "We must operationalize the loss and", "start": 322.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "damage fund and further we must keep the", "start": 324.88, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "1.5 degrees Celsius goal and sustain", "start": 328.639, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "methane maintain reduction.", "start": 333.039, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "This is not a substitute for long-term", "start": 336.96, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "decarbonization,", "start": 339.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "but can slow near-term warming, protect", "start": 341.759, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "vulnerability,", "start": 345.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "vulnerable communities and oceans, and", "start": 347.68, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "preserve critical time for those on the", "start": 351.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "front lines of the climate climate", "start": 354.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "crisis.", "start": 357.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Micronia endorses the proposed fuel", "start": 359.28, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "fossil fuel nonp proliferation treaty. A", "start": 363.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "chest and orderly transition away from", "start": 367.52, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "fossil fuel is now inseparable from the", "start": 370.56, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "wider geopolitical and economic", "start": 374.319, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "realities shaping global energy markets.", "start": 377.039, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "Instability in the Middle East and", "start": 382.319, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "volatile fuel prices are the", "start": 385.039, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "vulnerability of small island developing", "start": 387.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "states", "start": 390.08, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "to expensive fuel, unstable supply or", "start": 391.84, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "widespread economic fragility.", "start": 395.919, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Shift to renew renewable energy is an", "start": 399.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "economic necessity.", "start": 403.039, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Solar, wind, and oceanbased technologies", "start": 405.919, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "can reduce dependence on external fuel", "start": 409.759, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "markets, strengthen energy security, and", "start": 412.8, "duration": 8.399}, {"text": "lower emission. In line with science,", "start": 416.4, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "the world must accelerate the trans", "start": 421.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "transition to resilient, affordable, and", "start": 423.599, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "community centered renewable energy", "start": 427.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "system.", "start": 430.08, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Mr. President, our people are the most", "start": 432.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "important and most valuable", "start": 435.919, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "valuable national resource. We remain", "start": 438.639, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "committed to delivering effective public", "start": 441.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "services and advancing Micronia", "start": 443.919, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "priorities for our citizens wherever", "start": 446.72, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "they reside. I am pleased to announce", "start": 450.16, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "the adoption of Micronia's", "start": 453.199, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "national migration policy with the", "start": 455.919, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "technical support of the international", "start": 458.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "organization for migration.", "start": 461.599, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Micronia will strengthen the protection,", "start": 464.56, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "engagement and well-being of its", "start": 467.599, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "citizens including members of diaspora.", "start": 470.479, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "Micronia also aligns itself with the", "start": 475.44, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "global compact for sale safe, orderly", "start": 478.56, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "and regular migration and welcome and", "start": 483.039, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "welcomes its comprehensive framework for", "start": 486.879, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "promoting humane, orderly and", "start": 489.84, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "well-managed international migration.", "start": 492.72, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Mr. President and Excellencies,", "start": 497.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "our people's health has been", "start": 500.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "increasingly affected by more frequent", "start": 502.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "tropical storms, heat waves, and", "start": 505.12, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "changing tidal patterns. We are seeing a", "start": 508.96, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "rise in illnesses linked to marine life", "start": 512.479, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "and factor-born diseases in particular", "start": 515.599, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "deni and sika.", "start": 518.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Already the burden of non-communic", "start": 522.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "communicable disease", "start": 525.519, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "strains our health system reduces", "start": 527.839, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "workforce productivity", "start": 530.64, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "and diverse diverge limited resources.", "start": 533.12, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "We are strengthening our national health", "start": 537.519, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "capacity,", "start": 539.839, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "increasing investment in diagnostic and", "start": 541.36, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "life saving saving medicine,", "start": 543.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "expanding the use of tea health to", "start": 546.64, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "access specialist care and medical", "start": 549.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "education, and partnering with", "start": 552.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "neighboring countries to support regular", "start": 554.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "medical", "start": 557.279, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "exchange programs that augment our", "start": 560.08, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "treatment capability in country.", "start": 563.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "These efforts are essential to safeguard", "start": 566.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "our communities as climate impacts", "start": 569.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "intensify.", "start": 572.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Mr. President, the ocean is the heart of", "start": 574.88, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "micronian identity, livelihood, and", "start": 578.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "future prosperity. It faces mounting", "start": 581.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "pressure from climate change, sea level", "start": 584.64, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "rise, pollution, and unsustainable", "start": 587.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "exploitation.", "start": 592.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Micronia calls for a collective effort", "start": 594.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "to fortify ocean governance, sustainable", "start": 597.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "fishing management, and effective", "start": 600.88, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "conservation of marine biod diversity.", "start": 603.68, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Being the first country to sign the BPN", "start": 608.08, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "agreement,", "start": 610.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "we are among the first movers comprising", "start": 612.64, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "six nations to implement the BPN.", "start": 615.6, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Micronia is partnering with GIS and five", "start": 619.6, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "co-leading states to develop sea-based", "start": 623.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "management tools and marine protected", "start": 626.48, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "area proposals under the PB&J framework", "start": 629.36, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "translating our commitment to conserve", "start": 633.6, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "30% of our ocean into concrete durable", "start": 637.2, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "production protection for areas beyond", "start": 642.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "national jurisdiction.", "start": 645.68, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 650.64, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "on deep sea mining in the international", "start": 652.56, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "seabed area, Micronia employs a", "start": 655.279, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "precautionary approach. We stress the", "start": 658.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "need to consolidate comprehensive", "start": 661.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "knowledge, data, and science about the", "start": 663.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "marine environment before any decision", "start": 667.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "is taken on proceeding with", "start": 670.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "exploitation.", "start": 672.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Additionally, it is crucial that all", "start": 674.8, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "stakeholders including a chess and", "start": 677.839, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "coastal states indis uh people and local", "start": 680.88, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "communities in the Pacific are", "start": 686.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "meaningfully consulted prior to such a", "start": 688.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "decision.", "start": 692.24, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Mr. President, we must address the", "start": 694.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "growing threat of plastic pollution that", "start": 696.64, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "degrades the Pacific ecosystem and", "start": 699.6, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "communities.", "start": 702.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Marine debris, microlastics,", "start": 703.92, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "and associated toxic substances are", "start": 706.88, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "accumulating on our shores. Our lagoons,", "start": 710.0, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "for example, in the state of Chuk, where", "start": 713.76, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "oil leaks from World War II remnants led", "start": 716.8, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "to the emergency declaration last year,", "start": 721.04, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "continue to threaten our livelihood.", "start": 723.92, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "This impact imposed disproportionate", "start": 728.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "cleanup and economic burdens on small", "start": 730.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "island governments whose waste", "start": 733.839, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "management infrastructure is inadequate.", "start": 736.32, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "Our national efforts must be matched by", "start": 740.0, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "strengthened international cooperation,", "start": 744.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "including technical assistance,", "start": 746.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "predictable finance, and collective", "start": 749.279, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "actions across the plastic life cycle to", "start": 751.76, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "prevent pollution at its source and", "start": 755.76, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "protect the blue Pacific for present and", "start": 759.36, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "future", "start": 762.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "generations.", "start": 764.399, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Micronia calls on the international", "start": 767.2, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "community to match local action with", "start": 769.519, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "global responsibility", "start": 773.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "through sustained funding, meaningful", "start": 775.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "technology transfer, stricter upstream", "start": 778.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "control on plastic production, and an", "start": 781.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "end to waste exporting.", "start": 784.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Critically, the international community", "start": 787.36, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "must complete its work on a new treaty", "start": 790.48, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "to end plastic pollution, including the", "start": 793.92, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "marine environment.", "start": 798.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Mr. President and Excellencies, with", "start": 801.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "less than five years to achieve the", "start": 804.0, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "sustainable development goals, the", "start": 805.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "international community must respond", "start": 808.48, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "with re renewed political resolve,", "start": 811.12, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "scaled up financing, and accelerated", "start": 814.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "implementation.", "start": 817.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "The Pacific's experience underscores", "start": 820.16, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "this imperative. Climate impacts are", "start": 823.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "steadily eroding development gains and", "start": 826.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "placing progress across the goals", "start": 829.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "further at risks.", "start": 832.079, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "The recent typhoon and severe flooding", "start": 834.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "in our states and more frequent king", "start": 836.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "tides affecting our low-lying islands", "start": 839.68, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "demonstrate that these are no longer", "start": 843.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "isolated events, but recurring pressures", "start": 845.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "that test the resilience of our", "start": 849.68, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "communities on the front line of climate", "start": 852.24, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "crisis.", "start": 855.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "For us, achieving the STGS require", "start": 857.279, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "accelerated action.", "start": 861.839, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Mr. President and Excellencies,", "start": 864.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "our actions on gender equality continues", "start": 867.76, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "to address barrier to barriers to", "start": 870.56, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "women's leadership, economic", "start": 873.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "participation, and access to justice,", "start": 876.079, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "digital safety, and protection from", "start": 879.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "violence, particularly for women and", "start": 882.72, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "girls in remote and outer island", "start": 885.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "communities.", "start": 889.04, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "We are mainstreaming gender across state", "start": 890.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "and national planning, strengthening", "start": 893.279, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "survivor", "start": 895.76, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "centered services, expanding women's", "start": 897.6, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "economic empowerment and decision making", "start": 900.399, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and engagement, engaging in preventing", "start": 903.199, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "genderbased violence and advancing", "start": 906.639, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "equality.", "start": 910.079, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President on youth. I'd like to say", "start": 913.279, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "that our youth are taking active roles", "start": 917.199, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "in community advocacy, climate", "start": 919.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "stewardship, adaptation and mitigation", "start": 922.079, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "activities and services across our", "start": 924.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "nation. Building on these achievements,", "start": 928.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "our priorities are clear. strengthening", "start": 931.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "youth voices in decision making.", "start": 934.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Ex expanding skills training and", "start": 937.839, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "pathways to to decent work. Supporting", "start": 940.32, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "youthled climate and community action.", "start": 944.399, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Addressing substance abuse and mental", "start": 948.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "health and ensuring that young people", "start": 950.639, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "have the opportunity to lead, to serve,", "start": 953.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and to build a future for themselves and", "start": 957.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "their nation.", "start": 960.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Mr. President, we must implement the", "start": 962.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "multi-dimensional vulnerability index F", "start": 965.44, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Mi into a modern coherence and", "start": 968.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "responsive system that moves decisively", "start": 972.56, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "from con concept to practice.", "start": 975.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Doing so would unlock fair access to", "start": 978.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "concessional financing that reflect", "start": 981.839, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "structural vulnerabilities faced by", "start": 985.12, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "small, fragile, and highly exposed", "start": 988.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "economies such as the small island", "start": 991.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "states.", "start": 994.56, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Micronia reaffirms its strong commitment", "start": 996.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "to the progress of UNAD", "start": 1000.639, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "reform initiatives", "start": 1003.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "in addressing the UN country team", "start": 1006.079, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "reconfiguration.", "start": 1009.199, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "We firmly believe that both the", "start": 1010.72, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "multi-country office and the resident", "start": 1012.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "coordinator system must remain securely", "start": 1015.199, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "in place. Our distinct geographical", "start": 1019.12, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "landscape features incredibly remote", "start": 1022.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "communities.", "start": 1025.679, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "This reality is precisely why the UN AD", "start": 1027.839, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "reform initiatives", "start": 1031.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "matter so deeply to Micronia.", "start": 1034.319, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "For countries defined by distance,", "start": 1037.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "dispersion and vulnerability,", "start": 1040.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "reform cannot be an abstract exercise.", "start": 1043.6, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "It must strengthen the UN's ability to", "start": 1047.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "to to deliver deliver where the needs", "start": 1051.2, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "are greatest. Our priority is to create", "start": 1054.32, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "a UN architecture that preserves what", "start": 1058.0, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "works, fixes what does not work,", "start": 1061.84, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "and ensure that no community, no matter", "start": 1066.64, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "how remote and how small, is left", "start": 1069.52, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "behind.", "start": 1073.28, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Mr. President in its reform programs.", "start": 1076.16, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Micronia supports an expanded council", "start": 1079.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "that includes Brazil, Germany, India,", "start": 1083.2, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "and Japan as permanent members alongside", "start": 1086.24, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "permanent representatives for Africa and", "start": 1090.0, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "a dedicated nonp per uh permanent seat", "start": 1093.12, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "for small island developing states,", "start": 1098.24, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "SITS.", "start": 1101.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "This ensures that the most affected by", "start": 1103.28, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "global decisions are finally present at", "start": 1106.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the table.", "start": 1110.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Mr. President, digital transformation", "start": 1112.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and artificial intelligence", "start": 1115.28, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "offer significant opportunities to", "start": 1118.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "improve public service delivery,", "start": 1120.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "diversify economies, expand markets,", "start": 1123.52, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "access, and advance climate resilient", "start": 1126.96, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "development.", "start": 1130.24, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "As we are advancing digital", "start": 1132.16, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "connectivity, private sector development", "start": 1133.919, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "and trade opportunities,", "start": 1136.799, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "without adequate investment, capacity", "start": 1139.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "building and appropriate government", "start": 1142.559, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "governance, these technologies may", "start": 1145.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "increase inequalities and further hiden", "start": 1148.0, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "exposure to cyber security threats,", "start": 1152.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "information, misinformation", "start": 1155.44, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "and risk to data privacy.", "start": 1158.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "We therefore call upon international", "start": 1161.919, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "community to strengthen resilience", "start": 1164.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "resilient technical and digital", "start": 1167.76, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "infrastructure with ethical and", "start": 1170.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "effective cartrails and governance", "start": 1172.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "framework.", "start": 1176.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Mr. President and Excellencies,", "start": 1179.52, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "in closing, the up the priorities before", "start": 1182.08, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "us mentioned earlier are interconnected", "start": 1185.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "tests of whether the United Nations can", "start": 1189.2, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "deliver for all. For Micronia, success", "start": 1192.0, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "must be measured not by declarations,", "start": 1196.48, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "but by tangible improvements in our", "start": 1200.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "people's lives, security, and dignity.", "start": 1202.799, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "We call for equitable partnership with", "start": 1207.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "small island developing states through", "start": 1209.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "accessible finance, technology transfer,", "start": 1212.16, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "strong capacity and a meaningful voice", "start": 1215.919, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "in global decision. In the spirit of", "start": 1219.76, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "camarale, let us choose cooperation over", "start": 1223.039, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "division and build a f peaceful, just", "start": 1226.32, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "and sustainable future in which every", "start": 1231.039, "duration": 8.76}, {"text": "nation can thrive. I thank you.", "start": 1233.84, "duration": 5.959}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1245.28, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "thank the vice president of the", "start": 1247.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Federated States of Micronia.", "start": 1249.52, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "The assembly will now hear an address by", "start": 1253.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "his excellency.", "start": 1255.76, "duration": 2.64}]